  "system": {
    "identifier": "negative-emotion-sensing",
    "description": "<p>This is a perfected sensory ninjutsu based on the principles from “Kagura’s Mind Eye”. This jutsu digs further instead targeting a creature's emotions to track and keep notice of them from up to 100 feet away. You are able to immediately tell the emotional state or intentions of a creature within range. A Creature who attempts to hide these emotions must make a Deception check against your Ninjutsu Save DC. You can sense discomfort, enjoyment, anger, and even killing intent.</p>",
